<title>SOUTH KOREA: Yukong shuts crude unit for maintenance.</title>
<headline>Yukong shuts crude unit for maintenance.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Yukong Ltd said it closed down its No 5 crude distillation unit on Tuesday for an annual maintenance shutdown.</p>
<p>The refiner said the 200,000 barrel-per-day (bpd) unit was scheduled to resume operation on July 10.</p>
<p>Yukong, the nation's largest oil refiner, has a total refining capacity of 810,000 bpd.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
